=== k-1 ===
  P1: Make these boards match using as few instructions as you can. Can any other starts need more instructions?
  P2: How few instructions can make each pair match? Try every pair.
  P3: Invent a pair that needs exactly two instructions to match. Can you invent a pair that needs four?
  P4: Choose three instructions that make any two starts match. Could just two instructions always do it?
  P5: Use these two instructions. Make one starting pair that ends matching and another that ends different.
  P6: Try six draws from these starts, then start again. Could matching take more than three draws?
  P7: Keep drawing after the boards match. Can any instruction make them different again?
